# Setup guide: docs/ENV-SETUP.md
# One NAME=value per line. Restart Rover after edits (Settings reads env on startup).
# Do not commit .env.

# =============================================================================
# 1 · Discovery & research
# =============================================================================
# SERP + Keywords Data. Enrich needs Backlinks funded. Prospects uses Maps SERP + organic.
# Required for Discovery / research and Launched rank checks.
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN=
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD=

# =============================================================================
# 2 · Copy & AI
# =============================================================================
# Claude: Discovery Generate pack, Write site, Narrative, outreach (then Accept).
# Required for identity-linked / multi-workspace keys (Console → Settings → Workspaces).
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=wrkspc_…
# Optional overrides (defaults: claude-sonnet-5, medium effort).
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=medium
# Admin API key for API Cost (Console → Settings → Admin keys; sk-ant-admin01-…).
# ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_KEY=
# Optional override: total purchased credits in USD. Normally fetched automatically.
# ANTHROPIC_CREDIT_BALANCE=
# Same OPENAI_API_KEY is used for Review / Photo generate and Phone summaries.
# OPENAI_PHONE_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL=whisper-1
# OPENAI_PHONE_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# =============================================================================
# 3 · Site-config · address
# =============================================================================
# Home paste / Skip work without these. Find addresses needs Google Maps + APIFY_TOKEN
# and at least one of APIFY_LOOPNET_ACTOR_ID / APIFY_CREXI_ACTOR_ID.
# Google Cloud: billing + Places API (New) + Geocoding. Restrict the key to those two APIs.
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/places.googleapis.com
# Apify: https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations — prefer actors ~$1.20–$1.50 / 1K.
# Actor ids from the Store page (use ~ form), e.g. solidcode~loopnet-com-scraper
# maxItems per search URL on first pull (default 200, absolute max 2000).
# ADDRESS_SEARCH_MAX_LISTINGS=200
# Find: listing events ~$1.30/1K; Places Text Search est. $0.032/call.
# Re-Find uses a 7-day city cache (Apify $0) unless you Refresh / Fetch deeper.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
APIFY_TOKEN=
APIFY_LOOPNET_ACTOR_ID=
# Used when the Solidcode LoopNet build is still the July 31 1.0.2 actor, or a newer build returns no streets.
# Default one-api~loopnet-scraper. Set abotapi~loopnet-scraper to keep the slower listing-page backup.
# APIFY_LOOPNET_FALLBACK_ACTOR_ID=one-api~loopnet-scraper
# Listing-detail spaces (Address Find / suite backfill). Default one-api~loopnet-scraper.
# APIFY_LOOPNET_DETAILS_ACTOR_ID=one-api~loopnet-scraper
APIFY_CREXI_ACTOR_ID=

# =============================================================================
# 4 · Website · images
# =============================================================================
# Stock pull (Structure Include photos / Accept). GPT Image uses OPENAI_API_KEY above.
# https://unsplash.com/oauth/applications · https://www.pexels.com/api/ · https://pixabay.com/api/docs/
# IMAGE_SOURCES=unsplash,pexels,pixabay
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=
PEXELS_API_KEY=
PIXABAY_API_KEY=

# =============================================================================
# 5 · Assemble & launch
# =============================================================================
# One-time: gh auth login. TEMPLATE_GITHUB_REPO is also detected from git remote origin.
# Assemble sibling folders default to ../rover-sites if ASSEMBLED_SITES_DIR is unset.
# Cloudflare: user API token (account-owned tokens fail Builds API).
# Permissions: Account Workers Scripts (Edit), Account Settings (Read),
# Account Email Routing Addresses (Edit), Account Turnstile (Edit),
# Zone (Read), Zone DNS (Edit), Zone Email Routing Rules (Edit).
# Optional HTTPS zone flags (Always Use HTTPS / HSTS): Zone Settings (Edit).
# The Worker still 301s http→https without that permission.
# Optional push-to-deploy: Account → Workers Builds Configuration (Edit).
# One-time: any Worker → Settings → Builds → Connect GitHub.
# LEAD_NOTIFY_EMAIL is the Gmail that receives every form lead (and the Email Routing destination)
# (leads@ → this address). LEAD_NOTIFY_EMAIL is preferred; WEB3FORMS_DEFAULT_NOTIFY_EMAIL is still read if the new name is empty.
# Forms inbox (Phone/Form tab): also grant Account → D1 (Edit) and Workers Scripts (Edit).
# Phone/Form → Set up inbox creates the worker and saves its URL.
# Optional override (origin or full /submit URL). Leave unset to use the saved URL.
# ROVER_FORMS_INGEST_URL=https://rover-forms.your-subdomain.workers.dev
# Already-live sites report form leads after the next ship. Email via Web3Forms is unchanged.
# TEMPLATE_GITHUB_REPO=7D7D/Rover
# ASSEMBLED_SITES_DIR=D:\rank-and-rent-sites
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# LEAD_NOTIFY_EMAIL=you@gmail.com
GITHUB_OWNER=

# =============================================================================
# 6 · Phone
# =============================================================================
# Sites provisioner — not Launch. docs/PHONE-TRACKING.md
# Ranking DID → voicemail + SMS TWILIO_FORWARD_TO; on rent, same DID → renter.phone.
# Phone tab: greeting upload, spoken fallback, sync Calls/Recordings (no tunnel required).
# Optional live webhook relay while Rover is reachable:
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
# TWILIO_FORWARD_TO=+1XXXXXXXXXX
# TWILIO_VOICE_WEBHOOK_URL=https://rover-voice-xxxx.twil.io/inbound
# TWILIO_SERVERLESS_SERVICE_SID=
# ROVER_PHONE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string
# ROVER_PUBLIC_WEBHOOK_BASE=https://your-tunnel.example
# CallRail cancelled — do not use for new cutovers.

# =============================================================================
# 7 · Launched Sites · metrics
# =============================================================================
# Desktop OAuth client (enable Search Console API).
# Redirect: http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/gsc/oauth/callback
# Refresh token is saved under research/ after Connect Google — not an env var.
# GOOGLE_GSC_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_GSC_CLIENT_SECRET=

# =============================================================================
# Optional machine
# =============================================================================
# Dashboard port (127.0.0.1 only). Preview pool default 4322–4323 when slots=2.
# OPS_PORT=8787
# ASSEMBLED_PREVIEW_PORT_BASE=4322
# Assembled preview door count is Settings → Concurrent Limit → Assembled previews (default 5, max 8).
# ASSEMBLED_PREVIEW_SLOTS=2
# Heavy (Prepare / Launch) default also lives in Settings → Concurrent Limit.
# ROVER_SHIP_CONCURRENCY=2
# Discovery census places (default: in-repo data/census/SUB-IP-EST2025-POP.csv).
# CENSUS_POP_CSV=data/census/SUB-IP-EST2025-POP.csv
